      "name": "CASE 0419 — Vendor-themed Okta vishing wave",
      "description": "WORKING THEORY\nWaves of <vendor>-okta / -servicenow domains since late July support live vishing: the caller sends the target to the look-alike SSO page and talks them through a fallback MFA method.\n\nOPEN\n- any of the 13 domains resolving / serving a page today?\n- registrar + nameserver overlap between waves\n- which of our vendors appear in the pattern\n\nSOURCES\n- Dataminr TRACE brief, 19 Oct 2026\n- Okta reporting on MFA enrolment weaknesses (referenced by the brief)",
      "published": "2026-11-09T14:37:04.317Z",
