      "abstract": "Dataminr TRACE brief — Okta-themed phishing targets e-commerce providers",
      "content": "https://www.dataminr.com/resources/intel-brief/okta-themed-phishing-campain-targets-e-commerce-providers/\nPublished 19 Oct 2026. Waves of look-alike Okta / ServiceNow domains since late July 2026; September targeting pattern against e-commerce SaaS and infrastructure providers. Domains support vishing calls that walk users through an MFA downgrade (SMS / email code) to get past YubiKeys.\ndate: 2026-10-19",
